        "abstract": "Maneuver planning, burn execution and closed-loop guidance for Kitten Space Agency.",
        "description": "## Features\n\nPlans **maneuvers** and flies them, with _quick tools_ in the planner.\n\n- Flyby targeting and multi-pass burns\n- RCS-only burn execution\n\n1. Plan the burn\n2. Arm the autopilot\n\nRead the [manual](https://example.org/afc/manual), never a [rogue](javascript:alert(1)) one, and keep snake_case_names and \u00fcber_wert_ whole.\n\n![The planner window](ksa-image:planner)\n![The burn editor](https://example.org/afc/editor.png)\n\n[![Watch the demo](ksa-image:demo)](https://example.org/afc/demo)\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n[staging]\ndelay = 2.0\n\u0060\u0060\u0060",
